  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UP PGT Final Result With Institute Allotment Details 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-08T11:32:00+05:30\">August 8, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:32 am</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.upessc.up.gov.in/\">Uttar Pradesh Education Service Selection Commission (UPESSC)</a></strong> has released the <strong>Final Result</strong>\u00a0on its <strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>UP PGT examination</strong>. The UPSESSB PGT <strong>interview </strong>was conducted on<strong> 15 \u2013 27 June 2026</strong>. The last date to submit the <strong>application form was 16 July 2022</strong>. Candidates can check their<strong> Final Result</strong>\u00a0by logging into the <strong>portal using their enrollment number, registration number, or date of birth</strong>. The <strong>official link</strong> is provided below. <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(</strong></span></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Advt No. : 01/2022 &amp; 02/2022)</strong></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n          