<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/up-tgt-pgt-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start On :\u00a0<strong>09 June 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Registration Last Date :\u00a0<strong>10 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date<strong>:</strong><strong>\u00a013 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Form Submit Last Date<strong>:</strong><strong>\u00a0 16 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">New Exam Date (PGT):<strong> 09-10 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">New Exam Date (TGT):<strong> 03-04 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>30 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>06 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>12 May 2026\u00a0</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PGT Result Date : <strong>02 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Interview Date : <strong>15 \u2013 27 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Interview Letter : <strong>05 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Final Result : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>07 July 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>UPSESSB</strong><b>\u00a0</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>Gen/ OBC</strong> Candidates <strong>: \u20b9 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>EWS</strong> Candidates <strong>:</strong> <strong>\u20b9</strong><strong>\u00a0650</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC</strong> Candidates <strong>:\u00a0\u20b9 450/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>ST</strong> Candidates <strong>: \u20b9 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>PH</strong> Candidates <strong>: \u20b9 375/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Uttar Pradesh TGT/ PGT Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 July 2022</h5>\n<di